  "safety_and_limits": [
    "The reward and locked collateral are USDC.e on Polygon, while the captured gas conversion is Binance POLUSDT. Every net figure is explicitly a one-USDC.e-equals-one-USDT sensitivity, not an exact cross-stablecoin after-cost profit claim.",
    "The full-resolution-charge calculation is deliberately conservative because the eight resolution receipts contain 54 adapter resolutions and only 39 are scoped; the pro-rata view is also shown and still contains one negative observed proposal batch.",
    "A successful undisputed proposal returns locked collateral plus reward, but an incorrect or disputed proposal can lose bond capital. Zero disputes in one cluster does not establish zero future resolution risk.",
    "The observed proposer destinations and relayers may be private or protocol-operated automation. Public contract events do not prove that an independent user can access the same batching path or win the first-block race.",
